{"name": "The End of Magic", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWick has watched magic become a weapon for those who hoard it. Determined to end their grip on the world, he sets out to take that power for himself. His purpose may be different. But does that make his actions any better?<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"756\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/f99c13bba08a1405fb729a7ec7b14ced.poster.avif?t=1793392259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/f99c13bba08a1405fb729a7ec7b14ced.webm?t=1793392259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/f99c13bba08a1405fb729a7ec7b14ced.mp4?t=1793392259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover 110 spells</h2>Break through barriers, solve puzzles, and uncover hidden rooms with 110 discoverable spells. Shatter obstacles, pull distant levers, and move objects across gaps. Use each new spell to expand how you fight and where you can go.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"756\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/222e7c6247ae4c7e1eacb119d3fa1510.poster.avif?t=1793392259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/222e7c6247ae4c7e1eacb119d3fa1510.webm?t=1793392259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/222e7c6247ae4c7e1eacb119d3fa1510.mp4?t=1793392259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn your enemies into power</h2>Defeat enemies and absorb the aura they leave behind to fuel your own magic. Unleash your spells, draw in more power, and keep fighting. Switch to your staff to conserve magic or strike when your meter runs dry.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"756\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/77ef1e8b336d1e9105da7b63fce930c5.poster.avif?t=1793392259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/77ef1e8b336d1e9105da7b63fce930c5.webm?t=1793392259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/77ef1e8b336d1e9105da7b63fce930c5.mp4?t=1793392259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover the secrets of Wickmoor</h2>Explore tangled woods, search dark pools, and hunt for hidden spells and heart pieces. Descend into the Lamplighter Vaults, solve their puzzles, and learn the guardians\u2019 attacks as you fight your way deeper.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"756\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/67a4140cff9b7ff72309670d1609cd72.poster.avif?t=1793392259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/67a4140cff9b7ff72309670d1609cd72.webm?t=1793392259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/extras/67a4140cff9b7ff72309670d1609cd72.mp4?t=1793392259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </div>", "short_desc": "Explore a world where magic is falling into wicked hands in this top-down action adventure. Cast spells to fight enemies, break barriers, and pull distant levers. Absorb magic from fallen foes, or rely on your staff when it runs dry.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5448020/c7efbd42f0a26ff7ca8ef506d9ff09fd07d19c90/header.jpg?t=1793392259", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action-Adventure", "Top-Down", "Pixel Graphics", "Exploration", "Difficult", "Action RPG"], "developers": "Missing Page Studios", "publishers": "Missing Page Studios", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5448020", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/7rsY2VZhFPc", "first_seen": 1793314800.0, "review_rank": 0}